    "category": "clinical",
    "section": "Breadcrumb",
    "tag": "p",
    "text": "NICHD's research also focuses on understanding sexual risk-taking behaviors that increase the likelihood of individuals contracting STIs, on developing more effective educational interventions to prevent STIs, and on defining the consequences and optimal treatments for STIs, especially in pregnant women.",
