    "keyword": "Vaginitis"
  },
  {
    "source": "https://www.nichd.nih.gov/health/topics/stds/conditioninfo/symptoms",
    "title": "What are the symptoms of sexually transmitted diseases (STDs) or sexually transmitted infections (STIs)? | NICHD - Eunice Kennedy Shriver National Institute of Child Health and Human Development",
    "category": "clinical",
    "section": "Breadcrumb",
    "tag": "p",
    "text": "People with STDs/STIs may feel ill and notice some of the following signs and symptoms:1,2",
    "keyword": "Vaginitis"
  },
  {
    "source": "https://www.nichd.nih.gov/health/topics/stds/conditioninfo/symptoms",
    "title": "What are the symptoms of sexually transmitted diseases (STDs) or sexually transmitted infections (STIs)? | NICHD - Eunice Kennedy Shriver National Institute of Child Health and Human Development",
    "category": "clinical",
    "section": "Breadcrumb",
    "tag": "p",
    "text": "In some cases, people with STIs have no symptoms. Over time, any symptoms that are present may improve on their own. It is also possible for a person to have an STI with no symptoms and then pass it on to others without knowing it.",
    "keyword": "Vaginitis"
  },
  {
    "source": "https://www.nichd.nih.gov/health/topics/stds/conditioninfo/symptoms",
    "title": "What are the symptoms of sexually transmitted diseases (STDs) or sexually transmitted infections (STIs)? | NICHD - Eunice Kennedy Shriver National Institute of Child Health and Human Development",
    "category": "clinical",
