    "tag": "td",
    "text": "Retrieval type. This parameter specifies the format of the results. By default, results will be returned in brief format if no rettype is specified in the request. To specify a retrieval type, use one of the following possible values: brief - Returns the health topics as search results with abbreviated health topic records, keyword-in-context highlighting, and snippets (default). topic - Returns the health topics as full XML records with all associated vocabulary and links. all - Returns health topics in both brief and topic format.",
