    "title": "MedlinePlus: MedlinePlus Web Service",
    "category": "clinical",
    "section": "Optional Parameters",
    "tag": "td",
    "text": "A string with no internal spaces that identifies the resource which is using the Web service (e.g., tool=myservicename). This argument is used to help NLM provide better service to third parties using the Web service from programs. As with any query system, it is sometimes possible to ask the same question different ways, with different effects on performance. NLM requests that developers sending a large volume of requests include a constant 'tool' argument for all requests using the Web service.",
