    "title": "MedlinePlus: MedlinePlus Web Service",
    "category": "clinical",
    "section": "Optional Parameters",
    "tag": "td",
    "text": "Email address. If you choose to provide an email address, NLM may use it to contact you if there are problems with your queries. In addition to using the email address parameter, we encourage all Web service users to sign up for the email list referenced at the top of this page to receive general announcements and notifications of changes to the service.",
