    "title": "Menopause\n - NHS",
    "category": "clinical",
    "section": "general",
    "tag": "li",
    "text": "Menopause can happen naturally, or for reasons such as surgery to remove the ovaries (oophorectomy) or the uterus (hysterectomy), cancer treatments like chemotherapy, or a genetic reason. Sometimes the reason is unknown.",
