    "title": "Menopause\n - NHS",
    "category": "clinical",
    "section": "general",
    "tag": "li",
    "text": "Perimenopause is when you have symptoms of menopause but your periods have not stopped. Perimenopause ends and you reach menopause when you have not had a period for 12 months.",
    "keyword": "Vaginitis"
  },
