    "category": "clinical",
    "section": "general",
    "tag": "li",
    "text": "Menopause and perimenopause can cause symptoms like anxiety, mood swings, brain fog, hot flushes and irregular periods. These symptoms can start years before your periods stop and carry on afterwards.",
