  {
    "source": "https://www.nhs.uk/medicines/metronidazole/side-effects-of-metronidazole/",
    "title": "Side effects of metronidazole - NHS",
    "category": "clinical",
    "section": "general",
    "tag": "p",
    "text": "Like all medicines, metronidazole can cause side effects, although not everyone gets them.",
