    "category": "clinical",
    "section": "general",
    "tag": "p",
    "text": "Do not drink alcohol while taking metronidazole tablets or liquid or using the suppositories. Metronidazole can react with alcohol to cause side effects such as feeling or being sick, stomach pain, hot flushes, difficulty breathingand a pounding heartbeat (palpitations).",
