    "title": "Side effects of metronidazole - NHS",
    "category": "clinical",
    "section": "Common side effects of metronidazole",
    "tag": "p",
    "text": "Stick to simple meals and do not eat rich or spicy food. Always try to take your metronidazole after a meal or snack.",
