    "category": "clinical",
    "section": "general",
    "tag": "p",
    "text": "PrEP works by stopping HIV from getting into your body and making copies of itself (replicating). You'll only be protected from HIV infection if there are high enough levels of PrEP in your body, so it's important to take it correctly.",
