  },
  {
    "source": "https://www.nhs.uk/medicines/pre-exposure-prophylaxis-prep/how-and-when-to-take-pre-exposure-prophylaxis-prep/",
    "title": "How and when to take Pre-Exposure Prophylaxis (PrEP) - NHS",
    "category": "clinical",
    "section": "general",
    "tag": "p",
    "text": "Depending on how regularly you have sex and what type of sex you have, you can take them in 2 different ways: every day, or when you need it (on demand).",
