    "section": "Causes of hirsutism",
    "tag": "p",
    "text": "Hirsutism is usually linked to changes in androgen levels (\"male\" hormones). It can happen if the level of these hormones increases or if your body becomes more sensitive to them.",
    "keyword": "Vaginitis"
  },
  {
