    "title": "Acne\n - NHS",
    "category": "clinical",
    "section": "Things you can try if you have acne",
    "tag": "li",
    "text": "Regular exercise cannot improve your acne, but it can boost your mood and improve your self-esteem. Shower as soon as possible once you finish exercising as sweat can irritate your acne.",
    "keyword": "Vaginitis"
  },
  {
    "source": "https://www.nhs.uk/conditions/acne/",
    "title": "Acne\n - NHS",
