    "title": "Acne\n - NHS",
    "category": "clinical",
    "section": "Who's affected?",
    "tag": "p",
    "text": "In some cases, acne can continue into adult life. About 3% of adults have acne over the age of 35.",
    "keyword": "Vaginitis"
  },
